     3	What I learned:
     4	- A Zustand-backed stream store is a clean fit for shared live activity state across panels/components.
     5	- Hook-level pause/resume is easiest to enforce at the store write boundary (`addActivity`) so both mock and WebSocket sources obey it.
     6	- Mock generation with randomized 2-5s intervals creates believable agent activity without coupling UI development to backend readiness.
